=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Notice:}** Wait one game day and re-zone after completing {q:Better Part of Valor|Better Part of Valor|Better Part of Valor} before starting this quest.
* Speak to {n:Engelhart} in {z:Bastok Markets (S)} at (K-10). You are tasked with finding information about a potential Galka uprising.
* Speak to {n:Pagdako} in {z:Bastok Markets (S)} at (H-9)
** {n:Pagdako} is on the way from {n:Engelhart} to the homepoint.
* Return to the present day {z:Bastok Metalworks|Metalworks} and speak with {n:Iron Eater}, inside the President's Office at (J-8). You may need to talk to him multiple times
* Return to the past and speak with {n:Engelhart} again.
* Now head to {z:Grauberg (S)} and find the **???** inside the cave at (I-6) for a cutscene. The entrance to the cave is at (I-5), it's right on the border of H/I-5/6.
** The {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Grauberg (S)} puts you reasonably close.
* After the cut-scene return to {z:Bastok Markets (S)} and speak with {n:Engelhart} again.
* Head towards where the Metalworks entrance would be in {z:Bastok Markets (S)} and speak with {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} standing at the gate.
* Return to {n:Engelhart} and speak with him to complete the mission and receive your reward.

=2 Notes
* If continuing with Wings of the Goddess Missions, be sure to visit any of the {p:Cavernous maws} that you have unlocked outside {p:Jeuno} to activate the mission {p:Cait Sith|Cait Sith (Mission)} after completing this quest.
* Helpful Tip: If you set your homepoint to HP#1 in {z:Bastok Markets (S)} and use some form of warp, this counts as zoning.

